      </navPoint>
      <navPoint class="chapter" id="num_8" playOrder="7">
        <navLabel>
          <text>Chapter 6 IN WHICH FIX, THE DETECTIVE, BETRAYS A VERY NATURAL IMPATIENCE.第六章　菲克斯侦探很自然地流露出不耐烦的情绪</text>
